msgid "![Circom compile button in the Circom plugin panel](images/circom/compile-circom.png)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../circom.md:44
msgid "Circom compile button in the Circom plugin panel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../circom.md:47
msgid "The **Compile** button is disabled if the active file in the Editor is not a `.circom` file."
